      "description": "Compact home category link using the existing inline SVG fallback.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-category\" href=\"/categories\"><span class=\"ds-category-media\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15.75 10.5V6a3.75 3.75 0 1 0-7.5 0v4.5m11.356-1.993 1.263 12c.07.665-.45 1.243-1.119 1.243H4.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.12-1.243l1.264-12A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 5.513 7.5h12.974c.576 0 1.059.435 1.119 1.007ZM8.625 10.5a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0Zm7.5 0a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0Z\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"ds-category-title\">Everyday essentials</h3></a>",
      "css": ".ds-category{font-family:Figtree,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:row-reverse;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;min-height:72px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;background:var(--color-subtle, #f5f5f4);color:var(--color-ink, #24272b);text-decoration:none;}.ds-category-media{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--color-teal, #175b5a);}.ds-category-title{margin:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-category:hover{border-color:var(--color-control-hover, #454c53);}.ds-category:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-focus, #24272b);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product card fallback",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "product-card",
      "description": "Real missing-photo treatment; factual text remains visible without image assets.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-product-card\"><a class=\"ds-product-media\" href=\"/products\" aria-label=\"View product\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15.75 10.5V6a3.75 3.75 0 1 0-7.5 0v4.5m11.356-1.993 1.263 12c.07.665-.45 1.243-1.119 1.243H4.25a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.12-1.243l1.264-12A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 5.513 7.5h12.974c.576 0 1.059.435 1.119 1.007ZM8.625 10.5a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0Zm7.5 0a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0Z\"/></svg><span>Photo coming soon</span></a><p class=\"ds-product-meta\">Pack details</p><h3 class=\"ds-product-title\"><a href=\"/products\">Product name and selected pack</a></h3><p class=\"ds-product-options\">Choose options</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-product-card{font-family:Figtree,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;max-width:280px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--color-border, #d8dadd);border-radius:12px;background:var(--color-surface, #ffffff);color:var(--color-ink, #24272b);transition:border-color 150ms;}.ds-product-card:hover{border-color:var(--color-control-hover, #454c53);}.ds-product-media{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;aspect-ratio:1;padding:28px 8px 12px;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--color-muted, #5d6269);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;}.ds-product-meta{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-muted, #5d6269);font-size:12px;}.ds-product-title{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-product-title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-product-options{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-teal, #175b5a);}.ds-product-card a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-focus, #24272b);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-product-card{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Checkout inset field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "checkout-field",
      "description": "Persistent field label and source focus/invalid treatment.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-checkout-field\"><label class=\"ds-checkout-label\" for=\"ds-customer-name\">Full name</label><input class=\"ds-checkout-input\" id=\"ds-customer-name\" autocomplete=\"name\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-checkout-field{font-family:Figtree,Arial,sans-serif;position:relative;}.ds-checkout-label{position:absolute;top:9px;inset-inline-start:15px;max-width:calc(100% - 30px);color:var(--color-muted, #5d6269);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:16px;pointer-events:none;}.ds-checkout-input{font-family:Figtree,Arial,sans-serif;width:100%;height:64px;padding:26px 14px 9px;border:1px solid var(--color-border, #d8dadd);border-radius:12px;background:var(--color-subtle, #f5f5f4);color:var(--color-ink, #24272b);font-size:16px;}.ds-checkout-input:hover:enabled{border-color:var(--color-control-hover, #454c53);}.ds-checkout-input:focus-visible{background:var(--color-surface, #ffffff);border-color:var(--color-focus, #24272b);outline:2px solid var(--color-focus, #24272b);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-checkout-input[aria-invalid=true]{border-color:var(--color-sale, #b4232d);}.ds-checkout-field:focus-within .ds-checkout-label{color:var(--color-ink, #24272b);}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The searchable pharmacy",
    "overview": "Al Mina puts useful search before browsing and keeps real packs, prices and buying controls easy to compare. Coral emphasis, white product ground and charcoal typography form a compact retail identity; category rectangles and contained photography connect discovery to the catalogue.\n\nThis records the implemented customer storefront candidate on 15 November 2026, replacing the earlier forward specification under the owner’s explicit redesign instruction. Implementation does not establish owner visual approval or production deployment. The exact coral accent and search priority are owner requirements; supporting tokens are extracted from the build. Admin and wholesale retain independent systems.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Search leads the shared header on phone and desktop.",
      "Flat white product cards keep pack, availability, name, price and action together.",
      "Compact categories use links, images and wrapping labels.",
      "English Figtree and Arabic Alexandria carry equivalent task hierarchy.",
      "Mobile purchase access stays above bottom navigation and safe areas."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Coral Legibility Rule",
        "body": "Use ink labels on coral buying actions and reserve deep teal or ink for ordinary links on white.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The State Is Content Rule",
        "body": "Keep availability, savings, errors and pending outcomes explicit in words; colour alone does not establish a commerce fact.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Exact Pack Rule",
        "body": "Let identifying names and pack details wrap rather than clipping them to manufacture equal card heights.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Comparison Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the stable card plane; distinguish active boundaries and floating overlays without lifting every product surface.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use coral with ink foreground for primary buying emphasis.",
      "Do preserve complete pack identity, factual stock, actual imagery and locale-aware prices.",
      "Do keep visible focus, textual states, keyboard search and reduced-motion behaviour.",
      "Do compose RTL with logical geometry while retaining literal product and logo orientation.",
      "Do keep customer tokens scoped and preserve independent admin/wholesale consumers."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't turn implementation evidence into owner visual approval or production release acceptance.",
      "Don't use ordinary white labels on coral buying actions or small coral text on white.",
      "Don't invent ratings, certifications, delivery promises or sale states from reference imagery.",
      "Don't promote retained checkout blue/grey exceptions or legacy care-colour families into this palette.",
      "Don't introduce decorative kickers, card-lift choreography or duplicate fixed buying controls."
    ]
  }
}
